{"title": "Sudden Rush", "pageid": 39668, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Sudden_Rush", "categories": ["Class actions", "Actions", "Bugs"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Generic_Buff.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Generic_Buff.webp/300px-Generic_Buff.webp, /w/images/0/02/Generic_Buff.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Generic_Buff.webp/300px-Generic_Buff.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/02/Generic_Buff.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Sudden Rush</b> is a class action available to <a href=\"/wiki/Gnoll\" title=\"Gnoll\">Gnolls</a>. It combines the effects of a normal <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dash\" title=\"Dash\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cc/Dash_Icon.webp/20px-Dash_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cc/Dash_Icon.webp/30px-Dash_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cc/Dash_Icon.webp/40px-Dash_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Dash\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cc/Dash_Icon.webp/20px-Dash_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cc/Dash_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dash\" title=\"Dash\">Dash</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Disengage\" title=\"Disengage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/94/Disengage_Icon.webp/20px-Disengage_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/94/Disengage_Icon.webp/30px-Disengage_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/94/Disengage_Icon.webp/40px-Disengage_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Disengage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/94/Disengage_Icon.webp/20px-Disengage_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/94/Disengage_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Disengage\" title=\"Disengage\">Disengage</a>.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\nIncrease your <a href=\"/wiki/Movement_speed\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Movement speed\">movement speed</a> to 18 m (60 ft). Moving no longer provokes Opportunity Attacks.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/42px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a></dd>\n<dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/38px-Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Range: Self\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Range: Self</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 1 turn</dd></dl>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex\">\n  <div><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> UID</div>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: min-content auto; grid-gap: 6px; margin-left: 6px;\">  \n  <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Shout_SuddenRush_Gnoll</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_SuddenRush_Gnoll\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_SuddenRush_Gnoll\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n  </div>\n</div><div style=\"display: flex; margin-top: 12px\">\n  <div style=\"margin-right:6px\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/38px-Ico_Report.webp 1.5x, /w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico Report.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Spell flags</span></div>\n  <div><code><a href=\"/wiki/IsEnemySpell_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsEnemySpell (spell flag)\">IsEnemySpell</a></code></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Sudden_Rush\"> Condition: Sudden Rush </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sudden_Rush_(Condition)\" title=\"Sudden Rush (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sudden Rush\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sudden_Rush_(Condition)\" title=\"Sudden Rush (Condition)\">Sudden Rush</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 1 turn</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Movement_speed\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Movement speed\">Movement speed</a> is increased to 18 m (60 ft) and moving doesn't provoke <a href=\"/wiki/Opportunity_Attack\" title=\"Opportunity Attack\">Opportunity Attacks</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:\n<a href=\"/wiki/Gnoll\" title=\"Gnoll\">Gnoll</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Newborn_Gnoll\" title=\"Newborn Gnoll\">Newborn Gnoll</a>\n</p>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>The in-game tooltip states that it increases movement speed <i>by</i> 18 m (60 ft), but the actual increase is 9 m (30 ft) which is the same as a normal <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dash\" title=\"Dash\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cc/Dash_Icon.webp/20px-Dash_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cc/Dash_Icon.webp/30px-Dash_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cc/Dash_Icon.webp/40px-Dash_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Dash\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cc/Dash_Icon.webp/20px-Dash_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cc/Dash_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dash\" title=\"Dash\">Dash</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715052559\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.066 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.069 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2900/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 31250/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 11500/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 35/1000\nLua time usage: 0.019/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1430727/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n104.33%   62.169     33 Template:Trim\n100.00%   59.591      1 Template:Feature_page\n100.00%   59.591      1 -total\n 23.80%   14.180      3 Template:SmSAI\n 18.11%   10.789      1 Template:Feature_page/technical_section\n 15.05%    8.967      5 Template:Icon_text\n 13.86%    8.262      4 Template:Icon_link\n 12.28%    7.316      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 12.09%    7.205      1 Template:Condition\n 10.86%    6.474      3 Template:Main_namespace_only\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:39668-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715052559 and revision id 3664